WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.650
A spec sheet lists how much of each part a computer has.

2
00:00:04.578 --> 00:00:08.078
The processor is the chefs: how fast, and how many.

3
00:00:10.074 --> 00:00:13.724
RAM is the bench: what it is working on right now.

4
00:00:16.827 --> 00:00:20.727
Storage is the pantry: how much it keeps, and how far away.
